From repeated personal experience, I have found that when
I get hit in the head, I usually black out for a short while.

If I were in a dungeon, and a trapdoor suddenly opened and
dropped a rock on my head, and I didn't have a helmet, I'd
probably get knocked out for a few minutes.  This goes for
just about any time I'd get hit in the head...  

It may be too much trouble, but if you want to get technical,
you could have more regional hits, like the xan idea with the
legs.  Like, if you get hit in the sword arm, you can't swing
as well until it heals, or if you get hit in the stomach, you
can't hold as much food, etc.

